@MagicVilla_CouponAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5242
@AdminToken =

### Anonymous request: expected 401. No registration or write is performed.
GET {{MagicVilla_CouponAPI_HostAddress}}/api/coupon
Accept: application/json

### Set AdminToken locally from an authorized development session. Do not commit tokens.
GET {{MagicVilla_CouponAPI_HostAddress}}/api/coupon
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Invalid ID: expected 400 with an authorized admin token.
GET {{MagicVilla_CouponAPI_HostAddress}}/api/coupon/0
Authorization: Bearer {{AdminToken}}
Accept: application/json
